  notes: 'BS4 Station - Desk (direction A, Office floors below the first; Red 10-22 21:11, walls 2 Post Room by the map''s station skin). Plan D'' rev 3 (research/station/30_look.md 9-10) on the floor station contract: E1 south wall east cell 1.70 m on the set''s axis (x 7.80), E2 east wall middle cell 1.20 m. The set on its bracket on the north wall (the contract hangs every screen at 2.15 m or more, so no credenza), the key on the east wall 39 deg off the screen axis, 1.9 m; the guard''s chair rolled out under the screen, his back to E1. Held only in the profile''s stationDesk, never in the pool, never turned. Existing kits stand in for the sled guest chairs and the sign-in ledge.'
